  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound dry pinto beans",
    "1 large, meaty ham hock",
    "1 large onion, chopped",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "8 cups water",
    "1 teaspoon chili powder",
    "1 teaspoon salt, or to taste",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2ltUfK5VIhMTZL4VhLOKOwTfTQo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-1-a31252953d7444e99aeec5efa40fbb0a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine beans, ham hock, onion, garlic, and water in a large stockpot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rVvcnNzS5oEVA0apsQJOkgkuNvE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-3-a9c17232856a4f8d8832e2f413ffea12.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with chili powder, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MwBXOwnDoDxp1ng2X87kqnjY8rA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-4-51b5a5595cc64855a7fc1510b4d6b210.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil, and cook for 2 minutes. Remove from the heat, cover, and let stand for 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C4VqZVuATnry_jzHmhskxrMR7Bk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-5-a5b91dec9ac74c2baa86dc2149117c15.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "After 1 hour, return the pot to the stovetop and return to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until flavors have blended and broth has thickened, at least 3 hours, or up to 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JpWuCi6CW1iI6dSIY9RQSpuk6OY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-6-02b7a335bae94831b062fd0b42bb8907.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the last 15 minutes of simmering, transfer ham hock to a cutting board. Let sit until cool enough to handle, 5 to 10 minutes, then pull meat from the bone.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8rsNfte5soqtTl-gQnuKcncY3mQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-7-27806684b7844599b3717e5b00dfcaf0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/40203/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return meat to the stockpot and discard the bone. Adjust seasonings to taste.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N0BItVwBwFeKy7yk1YJ96G8d6X4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-40203-southern-ham-and-brown-beans-step-8-731fa07dd30a44c1a9b44c96797ecef5.jpg"
      ],
